<section class="privacy-content"><div class="container"><span class="eyebrow">Your information</span><h1>Privacy at a glance</h1><p>When you submit a care request, the information you provide—such as your name, contact details, patient name, location and requested service—is used to respond to your enquiry and coordinate a callback.</p><p>Website enquiries are sent to the care team through the configured email service. Please share only the information needed to discuss your request. Do not use this form for emergencies or send highly sensitive medical documents through it.</p><p>To ask about an enquiry or the information you submitted, contact <a class="text-link" href="mailto:homecare@subramanyafoundation.com">homecare@subramanyafoundation.com</a> or call <a class="text-link" href="tel:+919632554468">+91 96325 54468</a>.</p></div></section>
